 "title": "Jared Moskowitz",
 "intro": "Jared Evan Moskowitz (Democratic Party) is a member of the U.S. House, representing Florida's 23rd Congressional District. He assumed office on January 3, 2023. His current term ends on January 3, 2027.\nMoskowitz (Democratic Party) is running for re-election to the U.S. House to represent Florida's 25th Congressional District. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the Democratic primary on August 18, 2026.",
